  m_Name: EgretFact
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::AnimalFact
  animalName: Egret
  educationalText: Egrets use mangrove roots as hunting perches, standing above the
    water to spear fish, crabs, and shrimp trapped in the tangle. They also nest
    in mangrove canopies in large colonies, since the dense branches and surrounding
    water protect their chicks from predators.
